   "Atlas/Rudvalis/GaussianLocalFusionObstruction.lean:4:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `/-- Fusion from a coordinate row to outside that row rules out a 27-point\norbit equal to the coordinate-frame complement. This uses the actual full\nframe stabilizer, not a presumed final order of the Gaussian group. -/\ntheorem gaussian_no_coordinate_complement_orbit (K : Subgroup gaussianLatticeGroup) (p : Point) (x : E)\n    (y z : MinimalCross) (hy : y ∈ coordinateRowFrame p) (hz : z ∉ coordinateRowFrame p)\n    (hfix : ∀ g : K, g • coordinateCross (p, x) = coordinateCross (p, x)) (hmove : ∃ g : K, g • y = z) :\n    MulAction.orbit K y ≠ coordinateFrame \\ {coordinateCross (p, x)} :=\n  by\n  intro ho\n  have hK := gaussian_orbit_coordinate_complement K (coordinateCross (p, x)) y (coordinateCross_mem _) hfix ho\n  obtain ⟨g, hg⟩ := hmove\n  obtain ⟨a, ha⟩ := hK g.prop\n  have hax : a • coordinateCross (p, x) = coordinateCross (p, x) :=\n    by\n    rw [← codeGaussianHom_cross, ha]\n    exact hfix g\n  let b : MulAction.stabilizer codeGroup (coordinateCross (p, x)) := ⟨a, hax⟩\n  have hh := coordinateCross_stabilizer_row_mem p x b y hy\n  apply hz\n  change a • y ∈ coordinateRowFrame p at hh\n  rw [← codeGaussianHom_cross, ha] at hh\n  exact hg ▸ hh`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
